{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15104620","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104620","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1510462001:0":{"text":"ペルセウス、あれは<style=\"highlight\">ゼドランのトーテム</style>です……","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，刚才那是<style=highlight>赛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0E44A588B36138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510462002:0":{"text":"洪水も、虫の大群も、水面に浮かぶ死体も……すべてが、豊穣神様の下した裁きだというのか！？","source_cn":"你是要说这一切——洪水、虫灾、船橹一样漂浮在水面上的尸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6EDBB1A176BB9C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510462003:0":{"text":"なぜだ！なぜ神はホーリンを裁く！？神を崇め、愛してきた俺たちに何の罪があるというのだ！？","source_cn":"我们像往常一样敬奉他、爱戴他！呼临何罪之有？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE552B412737C03C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510462004:0":{"text":"俺は、ホーリンを救いたかっただけなのに。どうして、こんなことになってしまったんだ……！？","source_cn":"看看这座城……我试图拯救她，可她现在变成了什么模样？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD42DBAD5E3B04315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:11:1510463001:":{"text":"あれが見えるか！？","source_cn":"看啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9CF89E402607E46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docu